Usage:
  hub bootstrap [flags]

Flags:
      --bootstrap-context string   Use existing K8s cluster instead of Kind
      --build-flatcar-image        Trigger Packer build for Flatcar image
      --build-talos-image          Trigger Packer build for Talos image
      --debug                      Enable verbose logging
      --dry-run                    Validate prerequisites and generate manifests without provisioning
  -h, --help                       help for bootstrap
      --image-id string            OS image ID (Talos snapshot ID or Flatcar image name)
      --keep-bootstrap             Preserve Kind cluster after successful pivot
      --merge-kubeconfig           Merge generated kubeconfig into ~/.kube/config
      --name string                Hub Cluster name (alphanumeric + hyphens)
      --network-cidr string        Custom CIDR for Hetzner private network (default "10.0.0.0/16")
      --os string                  OS type: ubuntu (default) or talos (default "ubuntu")
      --region string              Hetzner region (fsn1, nbg1, hel1)
      --ssh-key string             SSH key name for Hetzner Rescue Mode emergencies only
      --upgrade                    Reconcile/update existing cluster components to match CLI version

